  ('abb-63b8b361', '2TAZ190200R0824', '2TAZ190200R0824', 'ABB SH802-C100 High Performance MCB', 'ABB', 'Switchgear', 'The SH800 series offers overload, short circuit and undervoltage protection for lines and power equipments. Suitable for industrial applications, the SH800 is manufactured according to international IEC standards, compliant to IEC 60947-2 up to 10kA. It is available in 80, 100, 125A versions and B, C, D, K tripping characteristics.', 6437, 6308, 'pc', 'https://shop.in.abb.com/media/catalog/product/6/6/66a838c112b479.10585453.png', true, true, 11829),
